# busops/ and coachmate/ are separate products nested here to match the
# brand hierarchy (see docs/BRAND.md) but are not part of this Vercel
# deployment — busops/ deploys to Cloudflare Workers, coachmate/ has no
# code yet. Keep them out of the Vercel build (large unrelated assets:
# a kiosk APK, TTS audio clips, busops/'s own node_modules).
#
# Exception: busops/shared/ (brand-tokens.css + two small icons) is a real
# build-time dependency of this dashboard — vite.config.js reads
# brand-tokens.css for the PWA manifest colours (see "Wire PCV Technologies
# brand colours through a single token source"). Ignoring busops/* (rather
# than busops/) and un-ignoring busops/shared/ keeps everything else in
# busops/ out while still shipping this one small shared directory.
busops/*
!busops/shared/
coachmate/
